<mjml lang="pt-BR">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Arte Foods | Semana 09.09</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Vai comprar 10 snacks? Ganhe 1 por R$0,99 e frete grátis a partir de R$99.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Nunito" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap" />
    <mj-raw>
      <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
      <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
    </mj-raw>
    <mj-breakpoint width="480px" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Nunito, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text padding="0" />
      <mj-image padding="0" border="0" />
      <mj-button border-radius="100px" font-family="Nunito, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-weight="700" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style inline="inline">
      .cta-link:hover { background:#7a3b1d !important; }
      a { color:inherit; }
    </mj-style>
    <mj-style>
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body, .page-bg { background:#121212 !important; }
        .content-bg, .content-bg table, .content-bg td { background:#1a1a1a !important; }
        .content-bg .copy div, .legal-copy div { color:#f1f1f1 !important; }
        .footer-bg { background:#633018 !important; }
        .footer-link, .unsubscribe { color:#ffffff !important; }
      }
      @media only screen and (max-width:620px) {
        .content-pad > table > tbody > tr > td { padding:36px 28px 28px 28px !important; }
        .footer-pad > table > tbody > tr > td { padding:30px 32px 26px 32px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#ebebee" width="600px" css-class="page-bg">
    <mj-section padding="0" background-color="#ffffff">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-image src="https://leonardoffaria.github.io/arte-foods-emails/semana-0909-snack-099/hero.png?v=1" href="https://artefoods.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-snack-099&amp;utm_content=hero" width="600px" alt="Semana 09.09 Arte Foods: vai comprar 10 snacks? Ganhe 1 por R$0,99." />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="content-bg content-pad" background-color="#ffffff" padding="38px 70px 30px 70px">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-text css-class="copy" align="center" color="#151515" font-size="16px" line-height="1.45" padding="0 0 22px 0">
          Você já tem os seus favoritos, mas sempre bate aquela vontade de experimentar um snack novo? <strong style="font-weight:700;">Agora você tem a desculpa perfeita para provar algo diferente!</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="copy" align="center" color="#151515" font-size="16px" line-height="1.45" padding="0 0 22px 0">
          Na Arte Foods, você encontra mini tortas, mini pizzas, mini quiches, kibes assados, empanados e muito mais para você variar no pedido.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="copy" align="center" color="#151515" font-size="16px" line-height="1.45" padding="0 0 22px 0">
          E nós temos a oferta perfeita para você garantir vários snacks de uma vez só: <strong style="font-weight:700;">na compra de 10 produtos, a 10ª unidade sai por apenas R$0,99.</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="copy" align="center" color="#151515" font-size="16px" line-height="1.45" padding="0 0 24px 0">
          <strong style="font-weight:700;">Além disso, compras a partir de R$99 têm frete grátis.</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://artefoods.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-snack-099&amp;utm_content=cta" css-class="cta-link" background-color="#633018" color="#ffd84f" font-size="16px" inner-padding="13px 22px" padding="0">ESCOLHA SEUS SNACKS</mj-button>
        <mj-text css-class="legal-copy" align="center" color="#4b4b4b" font-size="10px" font-style="italic" line-height="1.45" padding="22px 0 0 0">
          Ofertas válidas por tempo limitado. Ao adicionar 10 produtos ao carrinho, o item de menor valor terá seu preço alterado automaticamente para R$0,99.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="footer-bg footer-pad" background-color="#633018" padding="30px 70px 26px 70px">
      <mj-column width="36%" padding="0 22px 0 0" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-image src="https://leonardoffaria.github.io/arte-foods-emails/semana-0909-snack-099/footer-logo.png?v=1" href="https://artefoods.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-snack-099&amp;utm_content=footer-logo" width="67px" alt="Arte Foods" align="left" padding="0 0 22px 0" />
        <mj-text align="left" color="#ffffff" font-size="10px" line-height="1.5">
          Sabores artesanais feitos com carinho para o seu dia a dia. Tortas, quiches, mini pizzas e muito mais, entregues na sua porta.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="30%" padding="0 10px 0 0" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text align="left" color="#ffffff" font-size="10px" line-height="1.7">
          <a class="footer-link" href="https://artefoods.com.br/perguntas-frequentes" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Perguntas Frequentes</a><br />
          <a class="footer-link" href="https://artefoods.com.br/privacidade" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Privacidade e Cookies</a><br />
          <a class="footer-link" href="https://artefoods.com.br/termos-de-uso" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Termos de uso</a><br />
          <a class="footer-link" href="https://artefoods.com.br/contato" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Contato</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="34%" padding="0" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-button href="https://www.instagram.com/artefoodsoficial/" background-color="#ff4446" color="#ffffff" font-size="11px" inner-padding="8px 22px" padding="0 0 20px 0">NOS SIGA!</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="left" color="#ffffff" font-size="10px" line-height="1.8">
          <a class="footer-link" href="https://wa.me/5511961505468" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">11 96150-5468</a><br />
          <a class="footer-link" href="tel:+551146731228" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">11 4673-1228</a><br />
          <a class="footer-link" href="mailto:vendas@artefoods.com.br" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">VENDAS@ARTEFOODS.COM.BR</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="100%" padding="0">
        <mj-text css-class="legal-copy" align="center" color="rgba(255,255,255,0.72)" font-size="10px" line-height="1.5" padding="24px 0 0 0">
          <a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" class="unsubscribe" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);text-decoration:underline;">Descadastre-se</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
